<title>INDIA: Stocks which moved India's BSE Index - Jan 15.</title>
<headline>Stocks which moved India's BSE Index - Jan 15.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1997-01-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Following is an analysis of the 30-share Bombay Stock Exchange (BSE) index movement on Wednesday.</p>
<p>The table shows the stocks which moved the index most during the day and their percentage contribution to the net change.</p>
<p>The index at the close was 3646.73, 154.47 points or 4.42 percent higher than Tuesday's close.</p>
